{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":150120,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that DreamArtPhotography mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80191-jamaica-2018-just-starting-to-plan\/?view=findpost&p=1914879\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"bellabride2018\" Congrats!!!\nFeel free to check our pics \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":287113,"Name":"DreamArtPhotography","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287113.jpg?_r=1468680760","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1468616690,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":150057,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"bellabride2018,\n\nJasminMattPhoto has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Grand Bahai Princepe\".\n\nJasminMattPhoto said:\n======================================================================\nYou're very welcome.\n \nHonestly, we did a lot of review reading before we stayed at the GBP so we were a little worried before we arrived. Once we got there we found that the services were awesome. Our room was huge and clean. Every day the maids would come in and clean everything perfectly. We didn't have any issues with theft.\n \nThe buffets were plentiful, the food was actually really good. We did a handful of the a la carte restaurants and overall the food and experience was really good. The only bad part was our time at the Grill Resto. We had a really late dinner, like 9:30pm and the staff seemed really exhausted and slow. The food was still good though.\n \nThe one thing we had a problem with was after a few days the pool seemed really dirty. We stayed in the normal side (not the adults only) and we noticed quite a few drink cups, straws and hair in the pool. Maybe it was just the area we were in because we stayed in the same spot most days. That was really the only thing that bothered us at the resort, other than that we had an amazing time.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=13910&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1468416845,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":13910},{"Id":150052,"Title":"liked a post you made in Jamaica 2018 - Just Startin...","Message":"Hello!\n\nJasminMattPhoto just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHello Everyone!!!!I am recently engaged and starting to plan our 2018 wedding in Jamaica.  My other half had friends get married there and fell in love with the island!  We are just staring out with planning the wedding and are investigating all of the different resorts and what they offer....\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80191-jamaica-2018-just-starting-to-plan\/?view=findpost&p=1914841\n","Sender":{"Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1468415035,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":150051,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that JasminMattPhoto mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80191-jamaica-2018-just-starting-to-plan\/?view=findpost&p=1914844\n\n----------------------------------\nHola @\"bellabride2018\" !!! Congrats on your engagement and 2018 wedding. You are going to have such an incredible time in Jamaica. It is such a beautiful country and the people are so wonderful.\n \nWe recently stayed at the Grand Bahia Principe in Jamaica and photographed a wedding at the Jewel Runaway Bay.\n \nHere is a link to a galley of photos that I took of the grounds at GBP. You can see some of the great locations for ceremonies and especially for newlywed photos. \n   Here are a couple teasers from Jewel Runaway Bay as inspiration. Let us know if there is anything we can do to help with your planning <3      \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1468415016,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":150043,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"bellabride2018,\n\nTammyWright has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Welcome bellabride2018 to Best Destination Wedding\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHello bellabride2018,<br \/><br \/>Welcome to BestDestinationWedding.com (BDW). BDW is the Ultimate Resource for planning your destination wedding. We have over 70,000 registered bride, grooms and vendors.<br \/><br \/>Here are some links and tips that might make your time here on BDW more enjoyable.<br \/><br \/>If you have not done so, you may want to:<br \/>complete your profile (upload a photo, add profile details, etc.)<br \/>visit the Newbies forum and introduce yourself (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/23\/newbies)<br \/>Start your own wedding planning blog (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blogs\/)<br \/>find the forum for your wedding destination and create a subscription to threads\/members\/vendors that you are interested in<br \/><br \/>Here are some links that may be helpful to you:<br \/>Destination Wedding Community & Forum (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/)<br \/>Resort Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/resorts-villas)<br \/>Wedding Vendor Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/wedding-vendors)<br \/>Destination Wedding Tips and Articles (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips)<br \/>Wedding Image Gallery (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/recent\/albums)<br \/>BDW Help Page (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=help)<br \/>BDW Forum Rules and Etiquette (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/8853\/forum-faqs-etiquette-rules)<br \/>How to Download Attachments (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/48545\/update-1-18-2010-downloading-attachments)<br \/><br \/>Here are some BDW members and staff you should follow:<br \/><br \/>Moderators and Community Leaders<br \/>Tammy Host - Founder and Owner of BDW (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/206696-tammy-host\/). Tammy got married at Dreams Los Cabos in 2006<br \/>AlexisinJamaica (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/255437-alexisinjamaica\/) - Moderator & Community Leader. Alexis got married in Jamaica in 2013.<br \/><br \/>If you would like to \"like\" or \"follow\" us, here are our BDW accounts:<br \/>BDW on Facebook (http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Twitter (http:\/\/twitter.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Pinterest (http:\/\/pinterest.com\/bdwforum\/)<br \/><br \/>If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business, please email advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com (mailto:advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20Inquiry%20for%20BDW).<br \/><br \/>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read! (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010)<br \/><br \/>Please feel free to browse around and get to know others. If you have any questions please don't hesitate to ask. Hope you enjoy your time here.<br \/><br \/>Team BDW\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=13907#msg24061\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1468382175,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":13907}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"5","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
