> User bellabride2018 (287346)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"82.37.202.176","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80093,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"afd6aa610a70cad6a6d3a909fc71054f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Is anyone getting married at the Grand Bahia Principe Jamaica? We have just secured our wedding date for a 4pm ceremony in April 2017. :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It would be lovely to share experiences and questions with other brides!&amp;nbsp; :P&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have been pricing everything up and I think we will use the free package with the semi-private dinner and add on any extras as we wish! I think we will hire the gazebo for a couple of hours after the dinner for a dance.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve got lots of &lt;span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"&gt;questions&lt;\/span&gt; for anyone who can help -&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"&gt;How private is the Dolce Vita restaurant for the dinner?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"&gt;What is the cake like that is included in the free packages?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"&gt;Is the gazebo lit at night or is it essential to hire the lighting?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"&gt;When you pay per head for the drinks at the gazebo, is there a bar tender there?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"&gt;What&#039;s the resident DJ like?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"&gt;When you hire special chairs or bows, will these be transported from the ceremony to the dinner?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"&gt;Is the resort&#039;s wedding photographer good? I&#039;ve seen some lovely photos but they all seem to be from external photographers. The vendor fees are crazy!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have SO many questions! Would love to chat to any ladies who are getting\/have gotten married at the Grand Bahia Principe Jamaica!&amp;nbsp; :D&amp;nbsp; :D&amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913755,"PostDate":1463411084,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Is anyone getting married at the Grand Bahia Principe Jamaica? We have just secured our wedding date for a 4pm ceremony in April 2017. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It would be lovely to share experiences and questions with other brides!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have been pricing everything up and I think we will use the free package with the semi-private dinner and add on any extras as we wish! I think we will hire the gazebo for a couple of hours after the dinner for a dance.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've got lots of <span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">questions<\/span> for anyone who can help -<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">How private is the Dolce Vita restaurant for the dinner?<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">What is the cake like that is included in the free packages?<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Is the gazebo lit at night or is it essential to hire the lighting?<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">When you pay per head for the drinks at the gazebo, is there a bar tender there?<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">What's the resident DJ like?<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">When you hire special chairs or bows, will these be transported from the ceremony to the dinner?<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#ff0000\">Is the resort's wedding photographer good? I've seen some lovely photos but they all seem to be from external photographers. The vendor fees are crazy!\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have SO many questions! Would love to chat to any ladies who are getting\/have gotten married at the Grand Bahia Principe Jamaica!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kellylappleby@gmail.com","IpAddress":"82.37.202.176","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1463408823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kelly609","Id":286954,"Name":"kelly609","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.170.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80093,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"11546bc0bce43e7821e8c09c7c4c3ae7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the boards, kelly609, and Congrats on your Jamaican wedding next year!!! Setting your date and choosing your wedding venue are two BIG pieces of your planning process completed - well done :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...leaving you with some visual inspiration taken from our&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq&#039;&gt; &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;&#039;&gt;Riviera Maya Wedding Stories &lt;\/a&gt;in our beautiful Mayan Riviera to get those creative vibes flowing even more - enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_323a73cf2ef94832b4f86224d039a5a7.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_323a73cf2ef94832b4f86224d039a5a7.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_323a73cf2ef94832b4f86224d039a5a7.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_2bf05f6247d643a2b48d4083c4714181.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_2bf05f6247d643a2b48d4083c4714181.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_2bf05f6247d643a2b48d4083c4714181.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_95e2f9b45ee44d248c9009b03adb6140.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_95e2f9b45ee44d248c9009b03adb6140.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_95e2f9b45ee44d248c9009b03adb6140.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913766,"PostDate":1463429481,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the boards, kelly609, and Congrats on your Jamaican wedding next year!!! Setting your date and choosing your wedding venue are two BIG pieces of your planning process completed - well done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...leaving you with some visual inspiration taken from our<a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'> <\/a><a href='' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Riviera Maya Wedding Stories <\/a>in our beautiful Mayan Riviera to get those creative vibes flowing even more - enjoy!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_323a73cf2ef94832b4f86224d039a5a7.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_323a73cf2ef94832b4f86224d039a5a7.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_323a73cf2ef94832b4f86224d039a5a7.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_2bf05f6247d643a2b48d4083c4714181.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_2bf05f6247d643a2b48d4083c4714181.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_2bf05f6247d643a2b48d4083c4714181.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_95e2f9b45ee44d248c9009b03adb6140.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_95e2f9b45ee44d248c9009b03adb6140.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_95e2f9b45ee44d248c9009b03adb6140.\"><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.106.64.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80093,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a5b724f76914be6077ab395c3512302","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kelly609\"] &amp;nbsp;Hi! Congrats and welcome to the site! If you&#039;ve got lots of questions, this is a good place to be to get them answered! The ladies here are always willing to share.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m a GBPJ bride - Oct 2011. We loved the resort and fell in love with Jamaica! There is a whole GBPJ thread, which I&#039;ve added below for you. Definitely read it!! Whatever you have to ask, it&#039;s there believe me! This thread was so awesome for me when we got married. I know the thread is long but I&#039;m sure it will give you more information than you&#039;re looking for.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The Dolce Vita is considered semi-private, not private. Depending on the size of your group, all of the comments I&#039;ve heard are that the brides didn&#039;t even realize there were other people in the restaurant. If you&#039;re looking for a completely private venue then you can always rent out the Pisces club, which is down on the water, but it will cost. Last amount I heard I think was over $2000 but again, it&#039;s private. They will close it off for you and no one else can get in. I&#039;ve heard though that you need bug spray depending on the time of year because it is right down at the water. But it&#039;s so pretty when it&#039;s all lit up at night.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As to the gazebo, if you look through the gallery, and through the thread you&#039;ll see photos of the gazebo. I honestly can&#039;t remember if it&#039;s lit at night or not. I don&#039;t think it is just because I don&#039;t believe there is power down there. But don&#039;t quote me on that - take a look through the thread and I guarantee the answer is there.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Things have changed I know since we got married there four and a half years ago but I would go back there in a heartbeat. We loved the resort and had a great time. I posted a couple of photos as well in my gallery if you take a look.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/44634-any-gran-bahia-principe-runaway-bay-brides-out-there\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/44634-any-gran-bahia-principe-runaway-bay-brides-out-there\/&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913789,"PostDate":1463505842,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286954\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286954-kelly609\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kelly609<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Hi! Congrats and welcome to the site! If you've got lots of questions, this is a good place to be to get them answered! The ladies here are always willing to share.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm a GBPJ bride - Oct 2011. We loved the resort and fell in love with Jamaica! There is a whole GBPJ thread, which I've added below for you. Definitely read it!! Whatever you have to ask, it's there believe me! This thread was so awesome for me when we got married. I know the thread is long but I'm sure it will give you more information than you're looking for.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The Dolce Vita is considered semi-private, not private. Depending on the size of your group, all of the comments I've heard are that the brides didn't even realize there were other people in the restaurant. If you're looking for a completely private venue then you can always rent out the Pisces club, which is down on the water, but it will cost. Last amount I heard I think was over $2000 but again, it's private. They will close it off for you and no one else can get in. I've heard though that you need bug spray depending on the time of year because it is right down at the water. But it's so pretty when it's all lit up at night.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As to the gazebo, if you look through the gallery, and through the thread you'll see photos of the gazebo. I honestly can't remember if it's lit at night or not. I don't think it is just because I don't believe there is power down there. But don't quote me on that - take a look through the thread and I guarantee the answer is there.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Things have changed I know since we got married there four and a half years ago but I would go back there in a heartbeat. We loved the resort and had a great time. I posted a couple of photos as well in my gallery if you take a look.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/44634-any-gran-bahia-principe-runaway-bay-brides-out-there\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...des-out-there\/\u00a0<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.105.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80093,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8a6c0e34dbb1f3173d43645dfcfc481e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hola kelly609 and welcome to the community.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;While we haven&#039;t been to the Grand Bahia Jamaica yet, we will be travelling there next week. We are shooting a wedding at the Jewel Runaway bay but staying at the grand bahia so we would be more than happy to give you our thoughts about the resort when we return.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We should also mention that we are always willing to travel to photograph weddings and it should be noted that when you have guests staying at the resort AND photographing your wedding you won&#039;t have to pay the outside vendor fee.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just something to keep in mind ;)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Feel free to reach out to us if you have any questions at all.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914194,"PostDate":1465146870,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hola kelly609 and welcome to the community.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>While we haven't been to the Grand Bahia Jamaica yet, we will be travelling there next week. We are shooting a wedding at the Jewel Runaway bay but staying at the grand bahia so we would be more than happy to give you our thoughts about the resort when we return.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We should also mention that we are always willing to travel to photograph weddings and it should be noted that when you have guests staying at the resort AND photographing your wedding you won't have to pay the outside vendor fee.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just something to keep in mind <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Feel free to reach out to us if you have any questions at all.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\" alt=\"jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\"><\/p>\n<p><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\">+52 984-114-3386<\/span><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>Read our testimonials of appreciation from previous couples<\/a>\u00a0<3<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Rated 5 out of 5 stars on Facebook. <strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Check us out!<\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464799539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.98.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80093,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eda59fa06d4df67595737dd866efc96d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kelly609\"] Congrats!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jamaica it is so beautiful.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please fell free to check out our photos and blog.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18203]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914434,"PostDate":1466181883,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286954\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286954-kelly609\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kelly609<\/span><\/a> Congrats!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Jamaica it is so beautiful.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Please fell free to check out our photos and blog.<\/p>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18203-jamaica\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18203\/tn_gallery_287113_18203_1056790.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='jam2'  width='75' height='75'  alt='jam2' id='tn_image_view_83640_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18203-jamaica\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Jamaica<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>15 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span>Saludos<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><b>Virginia Hermosillo<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Dream Art \u00a0Wedding Photography<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span><span>contact<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:vhermosillo@dreamartphotography.com'>@dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>Tel: +(52) 998 246-5657<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com'>http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img src=\"http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com\/images\/wedding-logo-moto.png\" alt=\"wedding-logo-moto.png\"><\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span>","Email":"contact@dreamartphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.43.89","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1465498401,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287113.jpg?_r=1468680760","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DreamArtPhotography","Id":287113,"Name":"DreamArtPhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.150.154.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80093,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"175705aeacdf495e3b6a941665f21e0c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"kelly609\"] We are back from our stay at the Grand Bahia Jamaica. We had an amazing time, the resort itself is so beautiful and the staff are so friendly and helpful. You are going to have an absolute BLAST there for your wedding. &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are some photos from around the resort :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is a covered reception space by the beach, private and the breeze coming off the water will keep your guests cool.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Great spot for photos ;)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Where your ceremony could be, again quite private.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Lots of beautiful green space for newlywed photos&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Check out the rest of the thumbs below for more examples of the resort space. Grand Bahia Jamaica is really a beautiful resort&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":36108,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_002.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-98650200-1467300862.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-98650200-1467300862_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36110,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_004.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-03562500-1467300907.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-03562500-1467300907_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36111,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_005.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-79125300-1467300933.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-79125300-1467300933_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36112,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_006.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-26432700-1467300957.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-26432700-1467300957_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36113,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_007.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-44643700-1467300986.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-44643700-1467300986_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36114,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_008.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-78588800-1467301019.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-78588800-1467301019_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36115,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_009.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-51102200-1467301044.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-51102200-1467301044_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36116,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_010.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-54127200-1467301070.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-54127200-1467301070_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36117,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_011.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-98071600-1467301163.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-98071600-1467301163_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36118,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_012.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-42731200-14673011