ttp:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-40238400-1467301575_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36134,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_028.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-16836200-1467301597.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-16836200-1467301597_thumb.jpg","Width":802,"Height":1200},{"Id":36135,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_029.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-82368800-1467301628.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-82368800-1467301628_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":36136,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_030.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-54515400-1467301645.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-54515400-1467301645_thumb.jpg","Width":802,"Height":1200},{"Id":36137,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_031.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-28385700-1467301715.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-28385700-1467301715_thumb.jpg","Width":802,"Height":1200},{"Id":36138,"Name":"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_032.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-96900100-1467301741.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-96900100-1467301741_thumb.jpg","Width":802,"Height":1200}],"Id":1914595,"PostDate":1467305542,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286954\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286954-kelly609\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kelly609<\/span><\/a> We are back from our stay at the Grand Bahia Jamaica. We had an amazing time, the resort itself is so beautiful and the staff are so friendly and helpful. You are going to have an absolute BLAST there for your wedding. <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are some photos from around the resort <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914595]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-23035200-1467300843.jpg\" title=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_001.jpg -  66.69KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-23035200-1467300843.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_001.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>This is a covered reception space by the beach, private and the breeze coming off the water will keep your guests cool.<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914595]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-36373200-1467300884.jpg\" title=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_003.jpg -  105.1KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-36373200-1467300884.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_003.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>Great spot for photos <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914595]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-96627000-1467301211.jpg\" title=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_013.jpg -  119.41KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-96627000-1467301211.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_013.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>Where your ceremony could be, again quite private.<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914595]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-36650400-1467301376.jpg\" title=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_020.jpg -  158.07KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-36650400-1467301376.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Grand_Bahia_Jamaica_020.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>Lots of beautiful green space for newlywed photos<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Check out the rest of the thumbs below for more examples of the resort space. Grand Bahia Jamaica is really a beautiful resort<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\" alt=\"jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\"><\/p>\n<p><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\">+52 984-114-3386<\/span><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>Read our testimonials of appreciation from previous couples<\/a>\u00a0<3<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Rated 5 out of 5 stars on Facebook. <strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Check us out!<\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464799539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.127.211.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80093,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e11a465609912081a452acaaac0ecd20","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kelly609\"] Hi! Welcome and congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914657,"PostDate":1467683395,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286954\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286954-kelly609\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kelly609<\/span><\/a> Hi! Welcome and congrats!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407877786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
