{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":24065,"Author":{"Id":287346,"Name":"bellabride2018","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1468416068,"Content":"Thank you so much for the message!<br><br \/>\nAs you recently stayed at this hotel I am wondering if you can tell me how the service was.  From reading my different reviews I find people didnt like the service and in places it was not clean.","PostKey":"178a9df9232248827f1fd55ec9794703","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":24066,"Author":{"Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1468416845,"Content":"<p>You're very welcome.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Honestly, we did a lot of review reading before we stayed at the GBP so we were a little worried before we arrived. Once we got there we found that the services were awesome. Our room was huge and clean. Every day the maids would come in and clean everything perfectly. We didn't have any issues with theft.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The buffets were plentiful, the food was actually really good. We did a handful of the a la carte restaurants and overall the food and experience was really good. The only bad part was our time at the Grill Resto. We had a really late dinner, like 9:30pm and the staff seemed really exhausted and slow. The food was still good though.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The one thing we had a problem with was after a few days the pool seemed really dirty. We stayed in the normal side (not the adults only) and we noticed quite a few drink cups, straws and hair in the pool. Maybe it was just the area we were in because we stayed in the same spot most days. That was really the only thing that bothered us at the resort, other than that we had an amazing time.<\/p>\n","PostKey":"30f1348cf99ac585e53abad223b2c0a0","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":24089,"Author":{"Id":287346,"Name":"bellabride2018","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1468694984,"Content":"Thank you so much for the information. The better half and I have decided that is where we are going!!","PostKey":"95f9ae3db03eb5df2f91374a0998a19e","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":24090,"Author":{"Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1468695518,"Content":"<p>That is such exciting news!!!!!! We wish you the best of luck for your wedding and everything in life.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Think of us when you start looking for a destination wedding photographer.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you have any questions at all, you can always reach us here or via email at jasminandmatt@gmail.com\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Cheers!<\/p>\n","PostKey":"14c3bd5b5fade9a29645629a9981728c","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
